{"level":"debug","message":"Params: [\"COMPLETED\",\"2026-03-01 23:32:56 UTC\",{\"questions\":[{\"title\":\"Coin Change\",\"isSolved\":true,\"bestScore\":40,\"testCases\":[{\"input\":\"3 11\\n1 2 5\",\"expectedOutput\":\"3\"},{\"input\":\"1 3\\n2\",\"expectedOutput\":\"-1\"}],\"questionId\":\"cmm8dknmg00055d8s0mvdmv1c\",\"defaultCode\":\"// Write your code here\\n\",\"description\":\"Given an array of coin denominations and a target amount, return the fewest number of coins needed to make up that amount. If it's not possible, return -1.\\n\\n**Input Format**\\nFirst line: n amount (number of coins and target amount)\\nSecond line: n space-separated coin values\\n\\n**Output Format**\\nMinimum number of coins or -1\\n\\n**Constraints**\\n- 1 <= n <= 12\\n- 1 <= coins[i] <= 2^31 - 1\\n- 0 <= amount <= 10^4\",\"submissions\":[{\"id\":\"771a72ca-f859-4465-af18-279e5875e402\",\"code\":\"// Write your code here\\nimport java.util.*;\\n\\npublic class Main {\\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\\n\\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\\n        int amount = sc.nextInt();\\n\\n        int[] coins = new int[n];\\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n            coins[i] = sc.nextInt();\\n        }\\n\\n        int[] dp = new int[amount + 1];\\n        Arrays.fill(dp, amount + 1);  // acts like infinity\\n\\n        dp[0] = 0;\\n\\n        for (int i = 1; i <= amount; i++) {\\n            for (int coin : coins) {\\n                if (coin <= i) {\\n                    dp[i] = Math.min(dp[i], dp[i - coin] + 1);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n\\n        if (dp[amount] > amount) {\\n            System.out.println(-1);\\n        } else {\\n            System.out.println(dp[amount]);\\n        }\\n\\n        sc.close();\\n    }\\n}\",\"status\":\"ACCEPTED\",\"stderr\":null,\"stdout\":null,\"languageId\":91,\"memoryUsed\":20507,\"submittedAt\":\"2026-03-01T23:27:51.910Z\",\"compileError\":null,\"languageName\":\"Java (OpenJDK 17)\",\"executionTime\":0.277,\"testCasesTotal\":5,\"testCaseResults\":[{\"error\":null,\"input\":\"3 11\\n1 2 5\",\"passed\":true,\"memoryUsed\":21940,\"testCaseId\":\"cmluqamtg00tlzwnlhs5vk3fl\",\"actualOutput\":\"3\",\"executionTime\":0.057,\"expectedOutput\":\"3\"},{\"error\":null,\"input\":\"1 3\\n2\",\"passed\":true,\"memoryUsed\":21476,\"testCaseId\":\"cmluqamth00tnzwnl0pid2qet\",\"actualOutput\":\"-1\",\"executionTime\":0.055,\"expectedOutput\":\"-1\"},{\"error\":null,\"input\":\"[Hidden]\",\"passed\":true,\"memoryUsed\":16976,\"testCaseId\":\"cmluqamth00tpzwnlc2ow3vsi\",\"actualOutput\":\"[Hidden]\",\"executionTime\":0.052,\"expectedOutput\":\"[Hidden]\"},{\"error\":null,\"input\":\"[Hidden]\",\"passed\":true,\"memoryUsed\":21236,\"testCaseId\":\"cmluqamti00trzwnlf5f8yn65\",\"actualOutput\":\"[Hidden]\",\"executionTime\":0.057,\"expectedOutput\":\"[Hidden]\"},{\"error\":null,\"input\":\"[Hidden]\",\"passed\":true,\"memoryUsed\":20908,\"testCaseId\":\"cmluqamtj00ttzwnlhzkmxh5i\",\"actualOutput\":\"[Hidden]\",\"executionTime\":0.056,\"expectedOutput\":\"[Hidden]\"}],\"testCasesPassed\":5}],\"displayOrder\":0,\"bestSubmissionId\":\"771a72ca-f859-4465-af18-279e5875e402\",\"machineQuestionId\":\"cmluqamtg00tjzwnlaetthjf6\"},{\"title\":\"Product of Array Except Self\",\"isSolved\":false,\"bestScore\":0,\"testCases\":[{\"input\":\"4\\n1 2 3 4\",\"expectedOutput\":\"24 12 8 6\"},{\"input\":\"5\\n-1 1 0 -3 3\",\"expectedOutput\":\"0 0 9 0 0\"}],\"questionId\":\"cmm8dknmg00065d8sa252z5ha\",\"defaultCode\":\"// Write your code here\\n\",\"description\":\"Given an integer array nums, return an array answer such that answer[i] is equal to the product of all the elements of nums except nums[i]. You must solve it without using division.\\n\\n**Input Format**\\nFirst line: n (size of array)\\nSecond line: n space-separated integers\\n\\n**Output Format**\\nSpace-separated product array\\n\\n**Constraints**\\n- 2 <= n <= 10^5\\n- -30 <= nums[i] <= 30\\n- Product of any prefix or suffix fits in 32-bit integer\",\"submissions\":[],\"displayOrder\":1,\"bestSubmissionId\":null,\"machineQuestionId\":\"cmluqamsb00przwnlunf4vmcb\"}],\"summary\":{\"totalQuestions\":2,\"totalSolved\":1,\"totalPartial\":0,\"totalUnattempted\":1,\"totalScore\":40,\"maxScore\":80}},40,80,50,true,false,393,\"2026-03-01 23:32:56.002 UTC\",\"cmm8dpg8v000i5d8s2yvqf1pf\"]","service":"preplyte-api","timestamp":"2026-03-02 05:02:56"}
